iends - the dancer Ady Fidelin, the poet Paul Éluard and his wife Nusch, the Surrealists Man Ray and Roland Penrose - are well-known, others less so. They are spending the summer at the Hôtel Vaste Horizon with fellow artists Dora Maar, Eileen Agar and Pablo Picasso. A Vast Horizon tells the story of their creativity, friendships and pursuit of freedom set against the tense political backdrop of the 1930s, the Second World War and its aftermath.","thumbnailUrl":"https://books.google.com/books/content?id=6dqgEQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api","displaySummary":"In the South of France a group of friends picnic in a secluded clearing. The women have peeled down their dresses to their waists. Shoes have been cast aside. A couple kiss playfully while the others look on, laughing. The moment is captured in a now-iconic image by photographer Lee Miller. Some of the friends - the dancer Ady Fidelin, the poet Paul Éluard and his wife Nusch, the Surrealists Man Ray and Roland Penrose - are well-known, others less so. They are spending the summer at the Hôtel Vaste Horizon with fellow artists Dora Maar, Eileen Agar and Pablo Picasso. A Vast Horizon tells the story of their creativity, friendships and pursuit of freedom set against the tense political backdrop of the 1930s, the Second World War and its aftermath.","primarySubject":"Memoir & Autobiography","primaryTopic":"World War II","subjectEvidence":{"primarySubject":"Memoir & Autobiography","confidence":"medium","method":"evidence_score","candidates":[{"subject":"Memoir & Autobiography","score":7,"evidenceCount":1},{"subject":"Biography","score":6,"evidenceCount":1}],"evidence":[{"source":"google_books","scheme":"google_books_category","rawLabel":"Biography & Autobiography","mappedSubject":"Memoir & Autobiography","score":7,"confidence":"high","sourceId":"source-google-books-a-vast-horizon-artists-and-lovers-freedom-and-war-anna-thomasson","id":"subject-evidence-book-a-vast-horizon-artists-and-lovers-f